                                                "sense_id": "8f4e28cf-83c9-34ce-823b-0e51313b3a50",
                                                "text": "[…] those whose gender identity or expression is at odds with conventional understandings of dichotomous sex/gender categories (gender-neutral, polygender or genderqueer)."
                                            },
